slider15:50<0,150,1>-High Band Depth (%)
slider16:100<0,150,1>-Carve Intensity (%)
slider17:5<0.1,200,0.1>-Carver Attack (ms)
slider18:250<10,2000,1>-Carver Release (ms)
slider19:50<0,100,1>-Band Spread (%)

slider22:-30<-40,0,0.5>-Music Ceiling (dB)
