slider57:500<0,2000,10>-Quick Return Open (ms)
slider58:0<-24,24,0.1>-SC 2 Gain (dB)
slider59:0<-24,24,0.1>-SC 3 Gain (dB)
slider60:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-SC 1 On (3/4)
slider61:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-SC 2 On (5/6)
slider62:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-SC 3 On (7/8)
